* 19 Oct 26 dm  S.67 stage 2: CHECK.MASTERS and LIST.MASTER.PENDING end with the reason the last save of a master record in this session was refused, if one
*               was (kernel(K$MASTERS, 'refusal'), message 11594): an editor shows only "write error 8910".
* 19 Oct 26 dm  S.67 stage 2: CHECK.MASTERS lists the files a master edit could not be written into - nonwritable (the group has no write permission) and
*               norights (the mode is right and this session still cannot: mode, stale-session, not-a-member, no-write) - and says what each means (11593; replaced by 11982 on 26 Oct 26, F6, see above).
